ull,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":" var request = &pb.VerifyEmailRequest{\r\n         Email : \"emailAddress@gmail.com\"\r\n        Password : \"password\"\r\n}\r\n\r\nemail := \"emailAddress@gmail.com\"\r\npwd := \"password\"\r\n\r\n//Compare the both proto values with the variables email and pwd\r\nif request.Email == email && request.Password == pwd{\r\n//Run these code\r\n}\r\n\r\nSo when i executed this program , it returned an error : \"Marshal called with nil\"\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6415/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/6415/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/4094","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/4094/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/4094/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/4094/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/4094","id":760795040,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU3NjA3OTUwNDA=","number":4094,"title":"\"proto: Marshal called with nil\" after 1.34.0 upgrade","user":{"login":"alexshtin","id":2232524,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzI1MjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2232524?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin","html_url":"https://github.com/alexshtin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexshtin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":528927681,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1Mjg5Mjc2ODE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/P2","name":"P2","color":"610B0B","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":586671344,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODY2NzEzNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/Type:%20Bug","name":"Type: Bug","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2020-12-10T01:09:41Z","updated_at":"2021-08-05T01:42:15Z","closed_at":"2021-02-05T19:00:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What version of gRPC are you using?\r\n1.34.0\r\n\r\n### What did you do?\r\nAfter updating to 1.34.0 we started to get `proto: Marshal called with nil` when gRPC method is called and `nil` is passed as request parameter. I believe it is because of [this](https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/pull/3958/files#diff-293a65531749f976f0dfb6b75db3efb4f7eda5cc801550ebe8a2f7c64afa36e5R39) change. I agree, it is wrong, and I am currently fixing our code base but this is sort of breaking change and needs to be called out in release notes at least.\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/4094/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/4094/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/2882","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/2882/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/2882/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/2882/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/2882","id":460454318,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0NjA0NTQzMTg=","number":2882,"title":"How return specific response when handler panic","user":{"login":"asgmojtaba","id":8407187,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MDcxODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8407187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/asgmojtaba","html_url":"https://github.com/asgmojtaba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asgmojtaba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asgmojtaba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asgmojtaba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asgmojtaba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asgmojtaba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asgmojtaba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asgmojtaba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asgmojtaba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/asgmojtaba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":155505037,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTU1MDUwMzc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/labels/Type:%20Question","name":"Type: Question","color":"bfdadc","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2019-06-25T14:19:48Z","updated_at":"2019-12-29T07:02:06Z","closed_at":"2019-07-02T05:49:55Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Consider following service:\r\n\r\n\tservice MicroService {\r\n\t  rpc generalCall (RequestPr) returns (ResponsePr) {\r\n\t  }\r\n\t}\r\n\r\nso my handler look like this:\r\n\r\n\tfunc (h *GRPCHandler) GeneralCall(context context.Context, request *micro.RequestPr) (response *micro.ResponsePr, err error) {\r\n\t\tdefer func() {\r\n\t\t\tif r := recover(); r != nil {\r\n\t\t\t\tvar err error\r\n\t\t\t\tswitch r.(type) {\r\n\t\t\t\tcase string:\r\n\t\t\t\t\terr = errors.New(r.(string))\r\n\t\t\t\tcase error:\r\n\t\t\t\t\terr = r.(error)\r\n\t\t\t\tdefault:\r\n\t\t\t\t\terr = errors.New(\"unknown error\")\r\n\t\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t\t\tlog.Println(err)\r\n\t\t\t\tresponse = &micro.ResponsePr{StatusCode: -1}\r\n\t\t\t}\r\n\t\t}()\r\n\t\t////\r\n\r\n\t\tpanic(\"something exploded!\")\r\n\t}\r\n\r\nbut in case of panic i got this error: \r\n\r\n> ERROR: 2019/06/25 18:46:13 grpc: server failed to encode response:  rpc error: code = Internal desc = grpc: error while marshaling: proto: Marshal called with nil\r\n\r\nI wonder how this possible, why response not changed and remained nil?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/2882/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/2882/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/532","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/532/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/532/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/532/events","html_url":"https://github.com/grpc/grpc-go/issues/532","id":131791492,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMzE3OTE0OTI=","number":532,"title":"Server nil returns cause problems","user":{"login":"ashishgandhi","id":970540,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk3MDU0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/970540?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishgandhi","html_url":"https://github.com/ashishgandhi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishgandhi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishgandhi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishgandhi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishgandhi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishgandhi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishgandhi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishgandhi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishgandhi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ashishgandhi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2016-02-05T23:45:27Z","updated_at":"2018-09-26T16:02:21Z","closed_at":"2016-02-06T01:25:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In Go it is pretty idiomatic to return `nil, err` from a func when we encounter an error when the return values are a pointer and an error. The servers fail to marshal this `nil` while sending back a response to the client; and fatal logs. I think it might be better to do `new(T)` for the user before marshaling.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/532/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/grpc/grpc-go/issues/532/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}